00:41:11.280 --> 00:41:12.810
I did.

00:41:12.810 --> 00:41:15.222
Just so I could tell
you how amazing it was.

00:41:15.222 --> 00:41:16.055
Okay.

00:41:16.055 --> 00:41:18.263
I gotta tell you, Jeb took your turkey,

00:41:18.263 --> 00:41:20.363
